<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O hear, the Lord is speaking: Consider now your ways,</l><l>Ye sow and bring in little, for lacking is My praise.</l><l>Go up into the mountain, material to provide,</l><l>And build My house that I may be glorified.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Ye who are priests, ye remnant of Christians now obey—</l><l>The Lord Himself is with us, whatever men may say,</l><l>With spirits stirred and burning, now let us come to work;</l><l>May none his part with others in building shirk.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I’ll fill this house with glory, the Lord of hosts has said,</l><l>And the desire of nations will be exhibited.</l><l>Its glory will be greater than all that’s gone before,</l><l>And we will share this glory forevermore.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
